L001800	
L001801	
L001802	
L001803	In the effective theory, condensing a subset of them can lead to additional phases of the 1D defect labeled by the Lagrangian subgroups with the following generators:
L001804	\begin{itemize}
L001805	    \item $e_s, \bar{e}_s \text{ for } s = L, R$;
L001806	    \item $m_s, \bar{m}_s \text{ for } s = L, R$;
L001807	
L001808	\end{itemize}
L001809	
L001810	
